+Scan025 committed at 2026-11-21 07:34:43 UTC after eighteen distinct existing reader crops, each successfully viewed once. The initial combined delivery of two crop files failed unseen; the same files were subsequently inspected once. Its 34 decision entries include seven source-only S rows with C0/H0; the approved totals are C25/H27, 19 remaining doubtful loci, 36 inventory entries and zero page check events. Root journal §20 rescinded five added outer qualifier wrappers before release, retaining the exact original later-primary groups and every independently observed local state in the public record. That printing correction added no image view or reading decision, and the original eight C-row outcomes remained seven retained and one resolved.[^wf25]
